---
import { Icon } from "astro-icon/components";
---

<footer class="border-line/70 border-t">
	<div class="container-page py-14">
		<div class="grid gap-10 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-[1.6fr_1fr_1fr]">
			<div>
				<a href="#inicio" class="inline-flex items-center gap-3" aria-label="Ir al inicio">
					<img src="/Logo.svg" alt="" class="h-9 w-9" />
					<span class="font-display text-ink text-sm font-semibold">Edinson Amaya</span>
				</a>
				<p class="text-muted mt-4 max-w-sm text-sm leading-relaxed">
					Ingeniero de Sistemas y Full Stack Developer. Construyo software mantenible, con foco en
					arquitectura limpia y resultados reales.
				</p>
			</div>

			<nav aria-label="Navegación del pie de página">
				<p class="text-subtle text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase">Navegación</p>
				<ul class="mt-4 space-y-2.5">
					<li>
						<a href="#sobre-mi" class="text-muted hover:text-accent text-sm transition-colors">
							Sobre mí
						</a>
					</li>
					<li>
						<a href="#stack" class="text-muted hover:text-accent text-sm transition-colors">
							Stack
						</a>
					</li>
					<li>
						<a href="#experiencia" class="text-muted hover:text-accent text-sm transition-colors">
							Experiencia
						</a>
					</li>
					<li>
						<a href="#proyectos" class="text-muted hover:text-accent text-sm transition-colors">
							Proyectos
						</a>
					</li>
				</ul>
			</nav>

			<div>
				<p class="text-subtle text-xs font-semibold tracking-[0.18em] uppercase">Conectemos</p>
				<div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
					<a
						href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/edinson-amaya-ariza-47a1ab27a/"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
						aria-label="LinkedIn"
						class="border-line-strong text-muted hover:border-accent/60 hover:text-accent flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors"
					>
						<Icon name="ph:linkedin-logo-bold" class="text-lg" />
					</a>
					<a
						href="https://github.com/EdinsonAmaya"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
						aria-label="GitHub"
						class="border-line-strong text-muted hover:border-accent/60 hover:text-accent flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors"
					>
						<Icon name="ph:github-logo-bold" class="text-lg" />
					</a>
					<a
						href="/CV_Edinson_Amaya_Ing_Sistemas.pdf"
						download="CV_Edinson_Amaya_Ing_Sistemas.pdf"
						aria-label="Descargar CV"
						class="border-line-strong text-muted hover:border-accent/60 hover:text-accent flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-full border transition-colors"
					>
						<Icon name="ph:download-simple-bold" class="text-lg" />
					</a>
				</div>
				<a href="#contacto" class="btn btn-ghost mt-5">
					<Icon name="ph:paper-plane-tilt-bold" class="text-base" />
					Hablemos
				</a>
			</div>
		</div>

		<div
			class="border-line mt-10 flex flex-col gap-2 border-t pt-6 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between"
		>
			<p class="text-subtle text-xs">© 2026 Edinson Amaya. Todos los derechos reservados.</p>
			<p class="text-subtle text-xs">Construido con Astro y Tailwind CSS</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</footer>
